摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Aggressive context compaction for local-first agents. Runs Qwen3.8‑27B on self‑hosted llama.cpp at low context, shrinking history so the live prompt stays small, fast, and private—delivering a big‑window experience without API cost or data egress. 面向本地的激进上下文压缩插件。自托管 llama.cpp 低上下","id":"gh:1344287833","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-force-compact","slug":"falling-ts/dsh-force-compact","topics":["context-compaction","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Aggressive context compaction for local-first agents. Runs Qwen3.8‑27B on self‑hosted llama.cpp at l"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ow context, shrinking history so the live prompt stays small, fast, and private—delivering a big‑win"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"dow experience without API cost or data egress. 面向本地的激进上下文压缩插件。自托管 llama.cpp 低上下"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-force-compact"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Aggressive, local-first context compaction for DeepSeek Harness agents.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DSH **Cordis function plugin** that keeps the agent's working context lean by design: serve\n`Qwen3"},{"id":"p4s2","text":".8‑27B` on a self-hosted llama.cpp with a modest context, and the plugin shrinks the\nconversation it"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"self — a large-window feel with no API cost and no data egress."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Self-hosted inference** — the agent talks to a local OpenAI-compatible llama.cpp server\nthrough "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"the standard DeepSeek adapter; no separate adapter needed.\n- **Low context, high signal** — instead "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"of fighting a small cap, the plugin shrinks the\nconversation, so the agent reasons over a tight prom"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"pt while keeping deep memory in the\ncompressed head.\n- **Think off for compactions, passthrough ever"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ywhere else** — `disableThinking: true`\n(default) turns thinking off on *this plugin's own compactio"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"n summarization call only*;\nevery other model request rides the machine's configuration unchanged.\n-"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" **Private & free** — no per-token billing, no egress."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Two compaction engines coexist behind one facade (`resolveCompaction`), transparent to callers:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Engine | Used when | Notes |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| **Official** | the `compaction` service resolves in the agent realm | Preferred; delegates to `com"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"paction/basic`. |\n| **Builtin** | automatic fallback (typical standard preset isolates the service) "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"| Self-contained persistent transaction on `ctx.sessions` / `ctx.llm.stream` / `ctx.tokenMeter`; reu"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ses the official `compaction/*` event vocabulary, so it replays safely across builds. |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"No toggling — official wins when reachable, builtin takes over otherwise."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Trigger points"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Per-request guard (`agent/pre-step`)** — reads the session's *projected* context tokens\n(the exa"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ct number the harness renders bottom-right). At `autoThresholdTokens` it rejects the\noutgoing reques"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"t and compacts the head instead, retaining the latest `retainLatestTokens`\nverbatim. Below the thres"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"hold the request proceeds.\n- **Turn end / idle (`agent/status` → `idle`)** — when the agent quiesces"},{"id":"p14s5","text":", optionally\ncompacts via `compactNow` (gate: `turnEndForceCompactionEnabled`).\n- **Manual `/force-c"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"ompact`** — immediate `compactNow` when idle; when busy it queues a\nprocess-local flag consumed at t"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"he next model step. **Loaded lazily** — see \"Command\navailability\" under Install. In the `/` picker "},{"id":"p14s8","text":"the row carries the same face as the\nfirst-party commands: an icon, a localized name and a localized"},{"id":"p14s9","text":" description (the official\npresentation table only covers first-party commands, so the client half a"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"ttaches the face\nitself — see `AGENTS.md`, \"指令行的官方外观\").\n- **`session/flush`** — the awaited durabili"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"ce\nitself — see `AGENTS.md`, \"指令行的官方外观\").\n- **`session/flush`** — the awaited durability checkpoint."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Every path funnels into the single *\"compaction result landed in the session\"* boundary — the\nsame p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"oint where the LiveUI signal fires."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Decision key is `projectedTokens` (provider-anchored, same figure as the UI corner), so the\nplugin n"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ever drifts from what you see; the threshold-aware shrink gate skips summarizer calls\nthat provably "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"cannot pull the session below the threshold (kills the low-threshold dead loop)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The builtin transaction bills `shadowedTokenCount` from the **same** `tokenMeter.measure`\nper-node p"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"rices the official engine uses, so the meter's collapse protocol settles the drop\ncorrectly — the bo"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ttom-right counter goes *down* after compaction."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Thinking control: scoped to compactions"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Since the 2026-08 semantics revision, `disableThinking` controls **one thing**: whether this\nplugin'"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s own summarization call (`engine/builtin.js` → `engine/summarizer.js` →\n`ctx.llm.stream`) carries `"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"reasoningEffort:'off'`. Everything else is untouched:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Call site | With `disableThinking: true` |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Builtin-engine summarization call | Carries `reasoningEffort:'off'` |\n| Every other model request "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"(business, sub-agents, tools, other plugins) | Machine's `LlmCallConfig` unchanged |\n| Official `com"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"paction` service calls | Not routed through any plugin seam — unaffected |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**A route that cannot express `off` degrades instead of failing.** Not every catalog model\ndeclares "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"an `off` level — pi-ai's `thinkingLevelMap` may map it to `null`, as\n`opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flas"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"h` does (it accepts only `low` / `high` / `max`, while\n`deepseek/deepseek-flash` accepts `off` too)."},{"id":"p22s4","text":" The summarizer probes the route's capability\nbefore the call (`llm.resolveCallConfig`, a detached l"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ookup with no provider I/O) and, when\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Supporting modules:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- `src/hooks/guard.js` — `agent/request` pure pass-through + `pre-step` threshold gate +\nprocess-loc"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"al force flag (`thinkingDisabled` survives only as a legacy predicate).\n- `src/hooks/command.js` — t"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"he `/force-compact` command (lazily registered).\n- `src/hooks/idle.js` — turn-end forced compaction."},{"id":"p26s4","text":"\n- `src/hooks/wire-rewrite.js` — **retired**; keeps only the historical note on why the\n`llm/stream`"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" seam cannot carry wire fields. No exports.\n- `src/engine/region.js` — head/tail-anchored region sel"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ection (with the official pairing ledger).\n- `src/engine/summarizer.js` — the one-shot LLM summarize"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"r, aligned with official\n`compaction-basic` in **structure** (target resolution, prefix-cache alignm"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"ent,\n`purpose:'compaction'` tag, fail-closed finish classification, usage capture); the\nsummarizatio"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"n **instruction text is localized to Chinese** (structure identical, copy\nlocalized, with both `<com"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"pacted-summary>` tags kept verbatim). The official engine still\nuses the English instruction — see t"},{"id":"p26s11","text":"he \"摘要指令中文化\" section in `AGENTS.md`.\n- `src/engine/builtin.js` — the builtin persistent transaction "},{"id":"p26s12","text":"(official `compaction/*` vocab).\n- `src/engine/checkpoint.js` — preview + shrink gate + delegation t"},{"id":"p26s13","text":"o the compaction service.\n- `src/core/projected.js` — provider-anchored `projectedTokens`.\n- `src/co"},{"id":"p26s14","text":"re/ui-signal.js` — the LiveUI messenger."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
